# macOS
.DS_Store

## User settings
xcuserdata/
*.xcuserstate

## Derived data / caches (e.g. default Xcode build location)
DerivedData/

## Obj-C/Swift specific
*.hmap

## Playgrounds
timeline.xctimeline
playground.xcworkspace

# xcodegen-generated project file — regenerate with `xcodegen generate` (see project.yml).
# It churns on every generate/Xcode open, so keep it out of git — project.yml is the source of truth.
PassSumo.xcodeproj/

.build/

## Xcode build output (e.g. `xcodebuild ... -derivedDataPath ./build` writes here).
## Compiled artifacts must never be committed.
build/

## Claude Code agent worktrees — tooling scratch, never part of the tree.
.claude/worktrees/

## Machine-local artifact of store-assets/tools/set-wallpaper.sh: the absolute path of the
## wallpaper to restore. Per-machine state, never useful in another checkout.
store-assets/.wallpaper-backup
